**F3** uses ↔ (iff) instead of →, which is wrong (CONN): the sentence says "is nonuded as a lebome if" (sufficient condition), not "if and only if". It also DROPs "between two narils" and the specific list "nimote, gogiles, or other vibeds" (generalizes to just ToveksFodol(x)).

